{% extends './base.html' %}
{% load static %}
{% block links %}
    <h1 class="text-white">Bonus Links</h1>
    <div class="container bg-light rounded-3">
    <body class="sticky" style="background-attachment:fixed;background-color:rgb(163, 161, 161);background-image: url(https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/000/200/589/original/vector-retro-pattern-background.jpg);" >
        <p>Since the creation of this site I have come to use the domain name for a number of personal services and projects offered to friends, family, and anyone who seeks access (email <u style="color:blue">admin at wvlotterypredictor dot xyz</u>). I have decided to make these links publicly accessible in one place so no one will ask me for the link anymore. Thanks for your continued support and encouragement everyone!</p>

  <h3>Authentik</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://authentik.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://authentik.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self-hosted identity provider and single sign-on (SSO) solution. Handles centralized authentication and access control for services across this network.</p>

  <h3>2FAuth</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://2fauth.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://2fauth.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self-hosted two-factor authentication manager. Store and generate TOTP/HOTP codes for your accounts without relying on a third-party app.</p>

  <h3>Nextcloud</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://nextcloud.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://nextcloud.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self-hosted file sync and collaboration platform. A privacy-respecting alternative to Google Drive or Dropbox with support for calendars, contacts, and more.</p>

  <h3>Immich</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://immich.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://immich.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self-hosted photo and video backup solution. A Google Photos alternative with automatic device backups, album sharing, and AI-powered search.</p>

  <h3>Filestash</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://filestash.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://filestash.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Web-based file manager with support for SFTP, S3, FTP, and other storage backends. Browse and manage files from any browser without a dedicated client.</p>

  <h3>Jellyfin</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://jellyfin.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://jellyfin.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Media/streaming server with accompanying request server shown below.</p>

  <h3>Jellyseerr</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://jellyseerr.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://jellyseerr.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Requests page using the same accounts as the Jellyfin server, download your favorite movies and shows and have them automatically uploaded to Jellyfin!</p>

  <h3>Kasm</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://kasm.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://kasm.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Browser-based container streaming platform. Run isolated desktop environments, browsers, and applications entirely in your browser without installing anything locally.</p>

  <h3>Gitea</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://gitea.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://gitea.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self-hosted Git repository hosting. Browse code, manage projects, and collaborate with version control.</p>

  <h3>Searx</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://searx.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://searx.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self hosted search engine client indexing Google, DuckDuckGo, Qwant, Brave, and others.</p>

  <h3>Minecraft</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://prismlauncher.org">minecraft.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self hosted Minecraft server, currently running Java version 1.21.1, NeoForge 21.1.251 with several mods enabled, clicking the link leads to the Prism Minecraft Launcher client page. I highly recommend using it to set up the version and servers section using the corresponding link (minecraft.wvlotterypredictor.xyz) and versions mentioned above to be able to play in the world. The launcher is compatible with Windows, Mac, and Linux and the modpack used can be downloaded in a zip file via this <a href="/links/modpack">link</a>. Additionally, those using bedrock can join the server and play cross platform with Java players as well using the server address bedrock.wvlotterypredictor.xyz running Minecraft version 1.21.8.</p>

  <h3>Monero</h3>
  <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://monero.wvlotterypredictor.xyz">https://monero.wvlotterypredictor.xyz</a>
  <p>Self hosted Monero node for the privacy conscious on port 18081 and using the listed subdomain name, in addition I host an onion address (fdbkkiy4apxbrkonpsst3ghtkpgpqxz65jqgywvrqzsa5zpdou7vjnqd.onion) to access the node as well as an I2P link.</p>
